message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "tdgl-simulator"
abstract: >-
  Time-dependent Ginzburg-Landau simulation of vortex dynamics in constricted 
  superconducting thin films. The software is designed to study the dynamics and 
  power dissipation induced by moving vortices.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Tsai
    given-names: Idden
repository-code: "https://github.com/Idden/tdgl-simulator"
url: "https://github.com/Idden/tdgl-simulator"
keywords:
  - superconductivity
  - Ginzburg-Landau
  - vortex dynamics
  - computational physics
  - vortex dissipation
  - geometry effects
license: MIT
